  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1 is an Espressif development board with pin headers and USB programming connections. The official guide publishes revision-matching mechanical dimensions as DXF and PDF.\n\nOfficial v1.1 board-outline drawings are included. A complete-board STEP assembly was not found in the reviewed official resources, so a module STEP is not substituted for the board. Module, antenna and memory variants must be identified from the physical board before fit-critical design. Third-party boards using similar DevKit names are not covered."
    }
  ],
